# LAGA \'97 Lease Agreement Guard Agent\
\
### Mastering Agentic AI | October 2026 | Team 42\
\
LAGA is an agentic RAG application that helps North Carolina tenants understand residential lease agreements through intelligent document retrieval, deterministic fee calculations, and evidence-grounded answers.\
\
## Tech Stack\
- **Agent Orchestration:** LangGraph\
- **Vector Database:** Pinecone\
- **Backend:** Python\
- **Frontend:** Streamlit / React (TBD)\
- **Evaluation:** RAG and agent evaluation metrics\
\
## Core Features\
- Lease document retrieval with citations\
- Multi-step tenant question handling\
- Deterministic fee calculator\
- Evidence validation to reduce hallucinations\
- Tenant-specific lease retrieval\
\
## Team Workstreams\
- **Data & RAG:** Monica\
- **Agent & Tools:** Shriya\
- **UI & Integration:** Sudeep\
